      "content": "That makes sense from a systemic perspective. But some people argue that socioeconomic status doesn't explain everything—like, even when you compare students from similar economic backgrounds, there are still differences. Do you think there are any other, maybe deeper, cultural or even inherent factors that play into these performance gaps?",
